{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105590","id":2470128137,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TOyoJ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105590","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105590.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105590.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105590","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105590/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105590/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105590/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8640977426a06caf8a11e94432acdc0102c4dccc","number":105590,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add editor option to toggle idle parsing","user":{"login":"Cre8or","id":3143797,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDM3OTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3143797?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or","html_url":"https://github.com/Cre8or","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cre8or/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_(Rewritten on 11.03.2026 following a rebase)_\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an editor option to toggle idle parsing.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"693\" height=\"213\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2b0b4dc-f351-4893-a592-5689ce4f27b1\" />\r\n\r\nWhen idle parsing is disabled, the script editor will no longer automatically parse any opened script files. It will, however, continue to parse scripts:\r\n- when they are saved to disk, or\r\n- when another script is opened (e.g. by switching through scripts in the script editor).\r\n\r\nThat first point is worth elaborating on. Currently (Godot 4.6 / 4.7), scripts are not parsed in the script editor upon saving. Instead, you have to wait for the idle parsing timer to complete in order to have your scripts validated/checked for errors.\r\n\r\nI didn't aim to address that specific problem, as it was originally unrelated to my PR and worth a separate issue. However, with idle parsing disabled, this mechanism is the de facto primary way to parse files, which is why that change is part of this PR. It also happens to make the script editor feel snappier/more responsive when paired with idle parsing, which is a welcome bonus as far as I'm concerned. :stuck_out_tongue: \r\n\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/92998\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12411","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/rep